{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>His archers</b> — like השמיעו אל בבל רבים (Jeremiah 50:2)." "<b>I was embittered</b> — it corresponds to הכבד (his liver)."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {0 "The Hebrew lemma here is רביו, which Ibn Ezra glosses via the plural רבים in the Jeremiah verse; rendered 'His archers' following the standard English Bible translation of the Job context."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:49.320331126Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}